Package: proximtp
Title: Proximal Estimation for Modified Treatment Policies
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Antonio",
      family = "Olivas-Martinez",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "antonio.olivas@gmail.com"
    )
  )
Description: Estimates counterfactual means under modified treatment policies
    using proximal causal inference. Outcome and treatment bridge functions are
    learned in Gaussian reproducing kernel Hilbert spaces with weighted minimax
    objectives, nested cross-validation, and outer cross-fitting. Inverse
    probability weights for two-phase sampling are supported.
